      "writtenOn": "2018-02-22T19:31:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes please? It\u0027s also worth considering how we make this flexible when some other carrier prefers to use RSSNR or RSRQ or whatever we cook up for 5G when that comes along. We need to avoid making it overly complicated, but I think a 2-key solution is on the right track, or simply establishing a policy that we will use Pilot strength when available rather than broadband power measurement is also OK IMO... we may even be able to make a second key that\u0027s \"generic\" like POWER_MEASUREMENT_PREFERENCE \u003d \"broadband\" | \"pilot\" | \"snr\". I\u0027m going to file a bug on this where we can have a more thorough discussion.",
